        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Anxiety symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Longstanding mild anxiety, usually manageable. For the past 4–6 weeks has felt more wound up, especially at work on a noisy site with overtime; describes feeling more on edge than usual. Restless and keyed up, with mildly reduced concentration at work, especially in the late afternoon."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sleep onset delayed by 30–60 minutes; occasional early waking 1–2 times per week."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mood and safety symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mood described as pretty steady, cranky and anxious. No anhedonia, suicidal ideation, or thoughts of self-harm. PHQ-9 described as mild and not functionally impairing."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported associated symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies panic, chest pain, shortness of breath, palpitations, weight loss, fevers, and night sweats."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
